    {
      "number": 4239,
      "text": "They will say to their skins, “Why did you testify against us?” They will say, “It is Allah Who made us to speak, the One Who made everything speak. It is He Who created you the first time, and to Him you will be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
