      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4240,
      "text": "You did not bother to hide yourselves [when committing sins] from your hearing, your sight, and your skins lest they testify against you; rather you thought that Allah does not know much of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 415,
      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4241,
      "text": "Such was your assumption that you entertained about your Lord that ruined you, so you became losers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 415,
      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4242,
      "text": "Even if they endure patiently, the Fire will still be their abode; and if they seek to make amends, they will not be allowed to do so.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 415,
      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4243,
      "text": "We assigned to them [evil] associates[10] who made appealing to them what was before them[11] and what was behind them[12], so the decree [of punishment] became due against them along with nations that passed before them of jinn and men, for indeed they were losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 415,
      "hizbQuarter": 192,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4244,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve say, “Do not listen to this Qur’an, but make noise [when it is recited], so that you may prevail.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 416,
      "hizbQuarter": 192,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4245,
      "text": "We will surely make those who disbelieve taste a severe punishment, and We will surely recompense them according to the worst of what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 479,
      "ruku": 416,
      "hizbQuarter": 192,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4246,
      "text": "Such is the recompense of the enemies of Allah: the Fire, which will be their eternal home, as a recompense for their rejection of Our verses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
